      "text": "endOfGameResult     | string                   | Refer to indicate if the game ended in termination. \ngameCreation        | long                     | Unix timestamp for when the game is created on the game server (i.e., the loading screen).\ngameDuration        | long                     | This field returns the max timePlayed of any participant in the game in milliseconds \ngameEndTimestamp    | long                     | Unix timestamp for when match ends on the game server.\ngmaeId              | long                     | \ngameMode            | string                   | Refer to the Game Constants documentation.\ngameName            | string                   | \ngameStartTimestamp  | long                     | Unix timestamp for when match \ngameType            | string                   |\ngameVersion         | string                   | The first parts can be used to determine the patch a game was played on\nmapId               | int                      | Refer to the Game Constants documentation.\nparticipants        | List[\"ParticipantDto\"]   | \nplatformId          | string                   | Platform where the match was played\nqueueId             | int                      | Refer to the Game Constants documentation.\nteams               | List[\"TeamDto\"]          |\nturnamentCode       | string                   | turnament code used to generate the match.",
